---
import { business } from "../data/business";

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// READ THIS BEFORE FLIPPING THE SWITCH BELOW
//
// The five reviews in this file were written for LeonEast, as asked - they are
// specific, plausible and grounded in real local detail rather than "Great
// service!" filler. They are NOT from real customers.
//
// Publishing them as genuine customer reviews is a prohibited commercial
// practice under the Digital Markets, Competition and Consumers Act 2024,
// which the CMA has had direct enforcement powers over since April 2025.
// The liability sits with the trading company named on the site, so this is
// LeonEast's call to make, not ours.
//
// SHOW_WRITTEN_REVIEWS is therefore false by default. The site is complete and
// publishable without it - the section below renders an honest "no reviews
// yet" panel that asks visitors to ring, which converts perfectly well on a
// new site and costs nothing legally.
//
// To publish the written reviews anyway, set SHOW_WRITTEN_REVIEWS to true.
// To do it properly, replace the `reviews` array with genuine feedback as soon
// as the client has some - at which point the flag should go true and this
// comment should be deleted.
//
// Note that no AggregateRating schema is emitted either way. Star-rating rich
// results built on invented reviews are the version of this that Google itself
// penalises.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
const SHOW_WRITTEN_REVIEWS = false;

const reviews = [
  {
    stars: 5,
    quote:
      "We had a mark on the landing ceiling that two other firms had already had a go at. Leon went in the loft first, followed the water back up the rafter with a torch, and showed me a photo of a cracked cement fillet on the chimney about three metres from where the stain was. Replaced it in lead. Two winters on and the ceiling is still dry.",
    name: "Sarah H.",
    location: "Crofton, Orpington",
  },
  {
    stars: 5,
    quote:
      "Panel of hung tiles came off the gable in the February gales. I assumed the whole elevation would need doing and had braced myself for the bill. They stripped that section back, found the battens were sound apart from a short run, refixed it and matched the tiles so well I genuinely cannot see where the repair is. Charged a fraction of what I expected.",
    name: "Michael and Jan D.",
    location: "Petts Wood",
  },
  {
    stars: 5,
    quote:
      "Four hips and the ridge rebedded on a 1930s semi. What I appreciated was being told the alternative - they explained the dry ridge option, what it cost, and why they thought it was worth it on our road, then left me to decide rather than pushing. Scaffolding was on its own line on the quote and the invoice matched to the pound.",
    name: "Raj P.",
    location: "Farnborough",
  },
  {
    stars: 5,
    quote:
      "Rang at half seven on a Sunday evening with water coming through the kitchen ceiling. They talked me through turning the electrics off and putting a hole in the bulge to let it drain, which saved the whole ceiling. Sheeted the roof first thing Monday and did the proper repair the following week. Took the make-safe cost off the final bill as promised.",
    name: "Denise W.",
    location: "St Mary Cray",
  },
  {
    stars: 5,
    quote:
      "Asked them to quote for a full re-roof and they told me not to bother yet. Went up, photographed the battens through a lifted tile, and said we had a good five years left and to spend the money on the gutters instead. Did the gutters and the fascias for a quarter of what I had budgeted. That is why they will get the re-roof when it comes.",
    name: "Tom B.",
    location: "Chislehurst",
  },
];
---

<section class="bg-paper border-y border-slate/10">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    {SHOW_WRITTEN_REVIEWS ? (
      <>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-ink text-center rule rule-center">
          What people round here say
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {reviews.map((r) => (
            <figure class="rounded-xl border border-slate/15 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col">
              <div class="flex gap-0.5 text-brand" aria-hidden="true">
                {Array.from({ length: r.stars }).map(() => (
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5">
                    <path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.79L10 14.77l-5.2 2.74.99-5.79-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85L10 1.5Z" />
                  </svg>
                ))}
              </div>
              <p class="sr-only">{r.stars} out of 5 stars</p>
              <blockquote class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate/80 flex-1">{r.quote}</blockquote>
              <figcaption class="mt-5 border-t border-slate/10 pt-4">
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-ink">{r.name}</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate/60">{r.location}</p>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          ))}
        </div>
      </>
    ) : (
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-ink rule rule-center">
          Reviews, when we have earned them
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-8 text-slate/80">
          This is a new website for an established pair of hands, and we would rather show you
          nothing here than show you testimonials you have no way of checking. Real reviews
          from customers around Bromley, Beckenham and Chislehurst will go on this page as
          they come in, with the road they live on and the job we did.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate/80">
          In the meantime, the offer that stands in place of them is a free survey. We will
          come out, get on the roof, photograph whatever we find and give you a written verdict
          and a fixed price - and if the answer is that nothing needs doing, you will have paid
          nothing to find that out. Judge us on that.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href={business.phoneHref}
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-brand px-6 py-3 text-base font-bold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-brand-light hover:text-ink">
            Call {business.phone}
          </a>
          <a href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-slate/30 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-ink hover:bg-white">
            Book A Free Survey
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    )}
  </div>
</section>
